      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَرْعَنَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>affected the
nature,</i> or <i>disposition, of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَاعِنَة</span> [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْعَوْنُ</span>,
and here meaning <i>such as are inordinately proud</i>
or <i>corrupt</i> or <i>unbelieving,</i> &amp;c., <i>as were the Pharaohs</i>]. (S, * K, TA.)

